  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Just a Fool**: rare: 11 archived performances [2]\n- **Throwback**: rare: 14 archived performances [2]\n- **Thank you so much**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **You Get To Roam**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **All In Your Head**: rare: 10 archived performances [2]\n- **Over and Over**: rare: 11 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2019-07-12.AA-fob-mbhoKA500-DINa** (recommended): audience recording; 13 songs; 49 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- After Wonderful the file includes a Jenny Newtson outro, with Jim James solo acoustic and joined by Chris Funk and Laura Viers [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2019-07-12.AA-fob-mbhoKA500-DINa**: taped by ArchivalAudio; transferred by ArchivalAudio; source: fob Audience [1]. Also: Recorded by Ian Stoy of ArchivalAudio using MBHO KA 500 mics in DINa configuration, through Naiant preamps into a Tascam DR100 mkIII at 24/48; Mics were pole-mounted about 5'6\" high at front-of-board center, roughly 20 feet from the fence or 35 feet from the stage [1]",
